test_gptp_domain_is_one_source:
  [gate 26] gptp.domain 3 REFUSED with the 802.1AS-2011 8.1 clause; legal domain 0 reaches fabric configuration; CSR readback and protocol output are structural 0 in both shapes; the chain reaches the advertising plane's gptp_domain_i
test_gptp_dataset_matches_engine_announce:
  [gate 26b] AVB_INTERFACE == wire Announce for all 5 configs: priority2 248, clockClass 0xF8, variance 0x436A, clockAccuracy per board (AX7101 0x22, Arty 0xFE), log intervals -3/0/0; omitted keys fill from the engine and clockAccuracy from 8.6.2.3 b); the parser refuses a missing or twice-declared constant ([R-parallel] on #228)
test_gptp_clock_accuracy_per_board:
  [gate 26c] clockAccuracy per board (#843): the AX7101 build's image carries --clock-accuracy 0x22 and the Arty's 0xFE, each byte-equal to the generator's image for gptp_ucode_args() and different under the other value; values outside IEEE 1588-2008 Table 6 refused; milan_dp's gptp and gptp-lat legs run those two configs and grade the Announce octet on the wire
test_pp_window_contract:
  [gate 27] 5 processor-memory windows are single-sourced
test_station_mac_ul_bit_warns:
  5 configs: decided identity, no zero octet, one U/L-bit warning each
  U/L bit alone decides the warning: 2 universal variants silent, 2 local warn
  CLI: warning on stderr, exit 0, outputs written
