  [gate 28b] arty_current: all 29 writable names map byte-exactly to their READ_DESCRIPTOR fields
  [gate 28b] arty_4x4: all 55 writable names map byte-exactly to their READ_DESCRIPTOR fields
  [gate 28b] arty_8ch: all 87 writable names map byte-exactly to their READ_DESCRIPTOR fields
  [gate 28b] ax7101_8x8: all 107 writable names map byte-exactly to their READ_DESCRIPTOR fields
