  [gate 28b] schema_12_declared: all 39 writable names map byte-exactly to their READ_DESCRIPTOR fields
test_schema_12_keys_reach_the_image:
  [gate 25a] 5 tracked configs serve the pre-1.2 literals; all 11 schema 1.2 keys reach the image gen_aemi_image.py packs (id 0x001BC5CD179523AB -> 0x123456CD179523AB: OUI only); 11/11 single-key mutants named alone
test_schema_12_refusals:
  [gate 25b] 20 schema 1.2 misdeclarations refused by reason, the divergent entity_capabilities naming protocol-processor/hdl/adp/pp_adp_pkg.sv:53; an OUI the pin agrees with is accepted; with the refusal severed the image contradicts the declaration
test_schema_11_configs_accepted_unchanged:
  [gate 25c] 5 tracked configs declare 1.2.0 and load, re-declared 1.1.0, to the same argv, model id and image bytes; 2.0.0 refused
